    {
      "id": "W7221321864",
      "doi": "10.1016/j.optlastec.2026.116502",
      "title": "A disturbance-observer-based two-degree-of-freedom fractional-order internal model PID control method for liquid crystal optical phased array",
      "authors": [
        "Xuelian Liu",
        "Xinjie Ma",
        "Da Xie",
        "Jinyang Yu",
        "Chunyang Wang"
      ],
      "year": 2026,
      "venue": "Optics & Laser Technology",
      "venue_abbr": "Opt. Laser Technol.",
      "rank_label": "未匹配 CIE 2023",
      "keywords": [
        "liquid crystal optical phased array",
        "disturbance observer",
        "two-degree-of-freedom control",
        "PID control",
        "phase control"
      ],
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.optlastec.2026.116502",
      "cited_by_count": 0,
      "importance": 1,
      "score_basis": {},
      "role": "root",
      "reading_url": "items/370b354e-b1b6-4f1e-8238-ca933b5abf32.html",
      "summary": "摘要报告：针对液晶光学相控阵（LCOPA）因液晶弛豫特性与外部扰动导致的响应慢、稳态误差大、鲁棒性差，提出基于扰动观测器（DOB）的二自由度分数阶内模PID（SP-FO-IMCPID）波束控制：DOB实时估计补偿模型不确定性与扰动，Smith预估器补偿时滞，二自由度IMC分别优化目标跟踪与扰动抑制，引入分数阶提高整定灵活性，并以鲸鱼优化算法全局寻优。在搭建的LCOPA平台上完成阶跃、定点跟踪与鲁棒性实验，较整数阶PID、FOPID、FMAESO-FOPID缩短调节时间、抑制超调并提升跟踪精度与抗扰能力。",
      "summary_basis": "本站解读 · abstract-only"
    },
